819..896 Comment "/// A buffer allocated and freed: the allocation places it live, and the free"
897..972 Comment "/// hands it back to the scope that minted it. The `alloc` clause lends its"
973..1041 Comment "/// mint to a mock kernel, which fills it and hands it back with the"
1042..1092 Comment "/// completion, before the clause resumes with it."
